Fetched at build time, shipped inside the packaged application
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These assets are not stored in this repository. They are pinned by sha256 or by
commit and bundled into the desktop application; the script that obtains each one
names the origin it must come from. Most are fetched from the vendor's canonical
origin — two are not, and are marked as such:

  Tesseract language data (tesseract-ocr/tessdata_fast), Apache License 2.0
      Vendor origin. apps/desktop/scripts/bake-tesseract-langs.ts
  Multilingual NER weights, Apache License 2.0
      A community re-export on Hugging Face of Davlan's mBERT NER model, taken at a
      pinned commit; integrity comes from the sha256 pin, not from the host.
      apps/desktop/scripts/bake-ner-models.ts
  A CPython runtime and the wheels of the sandboxed interpreter
      Vendor origin (astral-sh/python-build-standalone, PyPI).
      apps/desktop/scripts/bake-python-runtime.ts
  docTR text-detection and recognition models, Apache License 2.0
      NOT a vendor download: a FIRST-PARTY ONNX export of Mindee's official
      pretrained weights, produced with docTR's own `export_model_to_onnx`.
      apps/desktop/scripts/bake-doctr-models.ts
  On-device embedding model — intfloat/multilingual-e5-small, MIT License
      NOT a vendor download: a first-party ONNX export and quantization of the
      published weights. No public upstream serves these exact bytes.
      apps/desktop/scripts/bake-embed-models.ts

A copy of this file and of the Apache License 2.0 ships inside the packaged
application, under its resources directory.

