Dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Dependencies installed from npm keep their own licences. Where a dependency is
offered under a choice of licences, this project elects the permissive one — for
`jszip`, the MIT term of its "MIT OR GPL-3.0-or-later" offer.

The copyleft-licensed packages present in the development tree (libvips behind
`sharp`, LGPL-3.0-or-later; `lightningcss` behind Tailwind, MPL-2.0) are build and
tooling dependencies: they are not declared by any workspace, no source file
